%%% note
DB コネクタの pooling-profile (PostgreSQL 16、localhost:15432 のコンテナ mulay-pg): maxPoolSize=1 で同時に 2 本使うと、
maxWait を過ぎた方が失敗する (DB:CONNECTIVITY)。結果を読み切った select と query-single は接続をすぐ返す。
実 Mule は select の結果 (ストリーム) を読み切るまで接続を返さない (1 件目だけ読むと要求の終わりまで持つ)。mulay は
結果をすぐ読み切るので、それに頼る /wait /seq /seq-first は記録しない (docs/compat/deviations.md)。
%%% port 18154
%%% request GET /exhaust
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  {
    "type": "DB:CONNECTIVITY",
    "description": "An attempt by a client to checkout a Connection has timed out."
  },
  {
    "type": "ok",
    "description": "ok"
  }
]
%%% request GET /seq-consumed
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

[
  {
    "n": 3
  }
]
%%% request GET /seq-single
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "n": 2
}
%%% request GET /after
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "n": 9
}
